  "headline": "OECD Projects Indonesia Fiscal Deficit To Reach 2.9 Percent In 2026",
  "seoTitle": "Indonesia State Budget Fiscal Performance",
  "metaDescription": "Reports detail Indonesia's fiscal landscape, including an OECD deficit projection, state revenue figures, and significant sector spending trends for 2026.",
